{"speciesId":162,"names":{"fr":"Fouinar","es":"Furret","en":"Furret","ja":"オオタチ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It makes a nest to suit its long and skinny body. The nest is impossible for other POKéMON to enter."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"There is no tell­ ing where the tail begins. Despite its short legs, it is quick at hunt­ ing RATTATA."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"It lives in narrow burrows that fit its slim body. The deeper the nests go, the more maze­ like they become."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"FURRET has a very slim build. When under attack, it can slickly squirm through narrow spaces and get away. In spite of its short limbs, this POKéMON is very nimble and fleet."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"FURRET has a very slim build. When under attack, it can slickly squirm through narrow spaces and get away. In spite of its short limbs, this POKéMON is very nimble and fleet."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"A FURRET has a very slim build. When under attack, it can squirm through narrow spaces and get away. In spite of its short limbs, it is very nimble and fleet."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"There is no telling where its tail begins. Despite its short legs, it is quick at hunting RATTATA."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It makes a nest to suit its long and skinny body. The nest is impossible for other POKéMON to enter."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"The mother puts its offspring to sleep by curling up around them. It corners foes with speed."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"The mother puts its offspring to sleep by curling up around them. It corners foes with speed."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"The mother puts its offspring to sleep by curling up around them. It corners foes with speed."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It makes a nest to suit its long and sk